Phase-0 out-of-grammar census: missing-operator classes + recovery curve
(326 fungal PKS in MIBiG 4.0; baseline statuses from reachability.csv)
  baseline: skip_element=112, unreachable=111, too_large=94, reachable=9

==========================================================================
RE-SCAN too_large (C>20) with lifted cap (C80)
==========================================================================
  re-scan outcome: unreachable=87, budget=7
  -> 0 were reachable-but-untested (scan-cap artifacts, NOT coverage gaps, excluded); 7 returned 'budget' (reachability not exhaustively confirmed at the reduced re-scan budget -- classified structurally below as a lower bound); the rest are confirmed unreachable. All non-reachable cores fold into the curves by actual missing class.

