==========================================================================
ENTANGLEMENT (CHO) -- how much of the recoverable-looking pile is clean
==========================================================================
  class-count distribution: 1-class=108, 2-class=67, 3-class=30
  need >1 operator class (entangled):            97/205  (47%)
  touch a hard/maybe-unsound class (ox/rearr):   178/205  (87%)
  CLEAN single-class aromatic (the doable pile): 22/205  (11%)
  aromatic BUT entangled with a hard class:      85/205  (41%)
  => 'build the aromatic operators' soundly recovers AT MOST the clean single-class
     aromatic pile; the aromatic-but-entangled cores need a hard operator too and may
     not be soundly expressible -- the proxy curve overcounts recovery exactly there.

