==========================================================================
VERDICT
==========================================================================
  CHO coverage shape: top-3 operator classes proxy-cover 91% of the 205 in-scope cores (UPPER BOUND).
  Clean single-class-aromatic floor (soundly buildable lower bound): 22/205 = 11%
  Concentrated-vs-asymptotic is read off Curve 1's steepness; how much of the
  concentrated part is real is read off the clean-vs-entangled split. Both reported;
  the entanglement fraction -- not the steepness -- gates whether 'solve the PKS core'
  is a finite grind or stalls on oxidative-rearrangement entanglement.
